# Local runtime data
# conf/runtime-truth.json is written during dashboard/runtime use.
# Keep conf/runtime-truth.seed.json tracked as the committed startup template.
# runtime_data/proofs contains timestamped local proof JSON/log/archive evidence.
# Those artifacts are copied into operator-uploaded evidence ZIPs, not committed to Git.
runtime_data/
runtime_data/**
runtime_data/proofs/
runtime_data/proofs/**
runtime_data/private_logs/
runtime_data/private_logs/**
test_runtime_data/
test_runtime_data/**
runtime-truth.json
conf/runtime-truth.json
